※ A constant at the top level is worked out from what it names when it is
※ first asked for, wherever that is written -- and one that reaches itself
※ that way has no value to answer with.

let A: u64 = B + 1
let B: u64 = A + 1

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let v: u8⟦A⟧ = ⟦1u8⟧ in ⎕static
    0u6
